	order_index: 13
	parent: "31575DEBB2A21CCD"
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>路径的工作原理</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>七约铸造了诅咒之环的镜子。同样的永恒，同样的七换七，规则却截然不同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你无法挥舞武器，无法攻击动物，所有怪物都会优先攻击你，站在黑暗中会让你动弹不得。你获得的回报是：幸运、更远的攻击距离、双倍战利品，以及无人能动的专属遗物架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>配得上资格</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>隐藏数字与另一侧相同，但不可调节。美德阈值是你存在于世界中的时间的</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>99.5%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，此整合包不会降低该数值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 也就是说，你应该尽早戴上这枚戒指，并且基本上永远不要摘下来。诅咒的副作用在这里要温和得多。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>自然能量代替法力</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"你的法术消耗世界的 </grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>Aura（灵气）</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，即自然灵气所追踪的资源。每个法术等级消耗约 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，乘以稀有度系数。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>普通： </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。不常见： </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>稀有： </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。史诗： </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>7次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>传说： </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10 倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 将周围的灵气完全耗尽会让世界对你产生敌意，而且这个过程并不友好。请在基地附近保持健康的灵气场。"
				""
				"佩戴戒指还会开启 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Sacrament</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 插槽。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "covenant_of_the_seven:virtue_ring"
			id: "6540D9003E61F4E2"
			min_width: 380
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.75d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>不是轻松的路。而是另一条艰难的路。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6D2250AF98AA3BEF"
				title: "我接受纪律的约束，并愿意接受惩罚"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>七美德</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B6EE86 to=#EAFFD6 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>先建造这个</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这一侧的一切都由自然光环驱动。你需要一个祭坛、一个可供汲取的光环场，以及最终在其下方的一个 </grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>转换催化剂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 自然光环有自己独立的章节和游戏内书籍。如果内容不熟悉，请先阅读那本书。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在祭坛上放置物品，为其注入灵气，等待。这就是全部操作了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "12A55B549C0DA083"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "06A0CB3C00C375B5"
				item: "enigmaticlegacy:earth_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#B6EE86>整条道路的起点。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1AEA6A2562B2AB5F"
				item: "naturesaura:nature_altar"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#EAFFD6 f=0.6>自然祭坛</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12A55B549C0DA083"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>祭品台</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在祭品桌上放置一个持有恰好 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,200,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点灵气的光环宝库，并用一个 </grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>诞生之灵</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 启动它。"
				""
				"[!warn] 宝藏必须包含足够的物品。部分填充的宝藏将不被接受。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个圣事都需要四个，而一些神圣遗物则需要更多，所以请正确建造光环基础设施。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "2F35D1ABDCAD56AA"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>一份贡品，而非一件工艺品。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7CB46AB0E26B9B2D"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:infinity_spirit"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>无限之魂</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>再次刷凋零者农场</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿戴七美德戒指杀死凋灵，它会掉落</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1至4个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这些物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 记住负担。穿戴的护甲越多，武器挥舞越不利，伤害也越低，所以请围绕法术、召唤物或不受影响的遗物来规划战斗。"
			]
			id: "3B4E460F4C196406"
			min_width: 340
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>由凋零的灵魂中提炼而出。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "108DCE2EBCC7F871"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:holy_essence"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>圣化精华</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12A55B549C0DA083"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>自然祭坛之上</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#D9A5FF to=#B06BE8 f=0.8>大地之心</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在自然祭坛上，伴随着约 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>25,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的灵气，持续约 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会进入圣石、崇高祝福、光明锻造祝福徽记、正义者、正义之镜、冰冻束缚堡垒和神圣步伐中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 多做一些。这是正义一方最常用到的物品。"
			]
			id: "73B4B9E39A9A5152"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "2122AA31685FBB30"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:pure_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>扭曲之心的镜子。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "185EB6BA2E66C94F"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:pure_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>净化之心</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B4E460F4C196406"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>金属</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在 <grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>Sky Ingot</grad> 周围放置四个 <grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Sanctified Essence</grad> 和四个 <grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>Birth Spirits</grad>。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>只有两样东西需要它，圣石和崇高祝福，但两者都至关重要。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "4F6B085E6DFD0EFA"
			min_width: 330
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>天空锭，已升级。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "592AD606B1D21438"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:sacred_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>圣化锭</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>龙之坠落</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>佩戴戒指，在达到 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>99.5 百分率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的虔诚度时击杀末影龙。它会留下一颗心，最多可掉落 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 颗，遍布整个世界。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 和深渊版本一样，它会精确地出现在龙死亡的地方，并且只属于你。离开前记得抬头看看。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能滋养沉睡圣事、崇高祝福与重生之床。这五种你都需要收集齐全。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5EF3157D4471721F"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>杀死那条龙。五次。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2377324EF5171829"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:seraphic_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>炽天使之心</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>美德的禁果</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有20%的几率，</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>埋藏着宝藏箱，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没有配方，所以多带些宝藏地图吧。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>吃了它会怎样</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每一口都会赋予你更多永久有益的增益效果，而且吃得越多，效果就越强。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 一旦用尽它的力量，你就只能再吃黄金食物了。普通面包将永远对你无效。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还改变了</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Seventh Virtue</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这样任何类型的伤害都可以被重定向到世界中，而不仅仅是法术伤害。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "197E8EB199BDFA5A"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>吃掉它。吃掉它。吃掉它！</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5CFE1F728D87A974"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:ambrosial_arbor"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>安布罗西亚尔树园</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["197E8EB199BDFA5A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>再思，神圣版</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>喝下后，Ambrosial Arbor 赐予你的恩典将被清除。永久效果会消失，黄金食物限制也随之解除。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 它是诅咒一侧的救赎药水（Potion of Redemption）的完全镜像。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "1839513C78451143"
			min_width: 330
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>撤销阿博尔。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3933C10B620927F2"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:damnation_potion"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>诅咒药水</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73B4B9E39A9A5152"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>耐久度即力量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个都与特定护甲部件的剩余耐久度百分比成正比缩放。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 头盔每点提供护甲，来自你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>头盔</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+0.5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每点盔甲韧性，来自你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>靴子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每件装备的最大生命值，来自你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Chestplate</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+0.25</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 击退抗性，每点来自你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Leggings</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 耐久度无法降低的物品将不被识别。除非涉及 Mnestia's Raiment，否则不可破坏的装备在这里毫无用处。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>一颗净化之心、一份神圣精华和四枚自然气息情感代币。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "581F2A1C0FD00B9F"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>你的护甲生命条变成了一个属性。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "651AA491DB41E82F"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:benediction_charm"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>光明祝福的徽章</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B4E460F4C196406"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>永久药水</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 魅力槽位，在该基础等级下获得的任何有益效果都将永久持续。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>搭配 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Melodious Harmony</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 穿戴，可将效果提升至增幅器 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 部分效果被排除在外，主要是飞行类和生命提升，因为这些组合即使在本模组的标准下也显得过于荒谬。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>圣化精华、召唤之灵、海洋之心、羽毛和萤石。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0ED765E7AE95722C"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>基础层增益永不失效。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "39D9E01527C3ECF3"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:potioneer_pearl"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>调合师珍珠</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73B4B9E39A9A5152"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>垂直逃生</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>凝视它，你将出现在最高的安全方块上，头顶正上方是开阔的天空。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这就是在Y=-50的洞穴里，第六重负担即将将你冻住时的救命答案。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>一颗净化之心、一个气场瓶、一块玻璃板和黄金。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "222DD8E1BA730F76"
			min_width: 330
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>笔直向上，出洞窟。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "20C942128C0FEB5F"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:righteous_mirror"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>正义之镜</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73B4B9E39A9A5152"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>攻击以恢复</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用此物品击中目标会对该目标执行以下所有操作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全恢复其生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全恢复其护甲耐久度。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>清除其火焰和冰冻计时器。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>移除其所有的负面效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>恢复其饥饿度并清除其攻击性。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键会发射一个投射物，落在哪里哪里就会点燃。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 再读一遍清单，想想你的队友。在多人模式中，这是一种治疗武器，而且效果非常好。"
			]
			id: "0148E8EE617361F9"
			min_width: 360
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>击中任何目标都能为其回血的武器。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "32E3F3758A3357B0"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:the_just"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>正义之士</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0148E8EE617361F9"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>盔甲变为武器</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"使用它就能做到 The Just 的所有事情，但对你无效。满血、满盔甲耐久度、清除火焰和冰冻、移除有害效果、恢复饥饿度。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>然后它会用你的</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的数值来造成伤害，这完全绕开了第三重负担。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>正义、圣石、仙果之树、休眠圣礼和四无限之灵。这是一个中后期合成配方。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "6251E52D66AA014C"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>正义之剑，指向自己。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1A6485080D4C46F1"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:the_aeternum"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>永恒纪元</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73B4B9E39A9A5152"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>保护他人</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Shift 加右键任意实体以标记其为受保护。当你在该实体 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格范围内时，它受到的所有伤害都会转移到你的身上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能立即从所有方向放置方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无法被斧头破坏。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>近战击中你的任何东西都会被冰冻。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>被阻挡的投射物会朝你正在看的方向反弹回来。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能让你摆脱刺骨的寒冷，从而解除第五重负担。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还会改变 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>第一重负担</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。当你在受保护实体附近时，又可以正常使用剑了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 最后一行才是真正的奖励。这是正义玩家能挥舞剑的唯一途径。"
			]
			id: "15DF45153882F214"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>贴身护卫的盾牌。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4BAD387C164416C7"
				item: {
