			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>冰封禁锢堡垒</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>饥饿即铠甲</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>正午时分，你的饥饿值和饱和度会迅速增加。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>盔甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会根据饥饿度而变化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会随着你的饱和度水平而变化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>第三重负担的伤害减免上限降低 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在自然祭坛上，用黄金胡萝卜和转化催化剂，消耗了 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>676,767</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点灵气制作而成。选这个数字的人一定很有趣。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "14CD90939DDC7470"
			min_width: 350
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>吃好点，穿好甲。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7C3AB20CB821525E"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:serendipity_feast"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>机缘巧合的盛宴</grad></shadow>"
			x: -0.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6540D9003E61F4E2"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>召唤者支援</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+75</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>召唤伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你拥有的所有召唤物都会获得来自</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>《千德卷轴》和</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>以及</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>《光明祝福徽记》的加成效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有了调药师珍珠，有益效果的增幅器将变为无限大。</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在丛林树苗上，用弓、线、召唤师护身符和金叶进行森林仪式。大约需要 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>35分钟</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 召唤生物不介意你不能挥舞武器。对于正义的玩家来说，这显然是战斗的最佳方式。"
			]
			id: "0323DE80B83B7249"
			min_width: 350
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>你的召唤物会继承一切。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "402C11BF61293B90"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:melodious_harmony"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>悦耳的和谐</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2F35D1ABDCAD56AA"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>赤手空拳变为现实</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>拳击造成的伤害取决于你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的击退取决于你的 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>击退抗性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会改变 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>第三重负担</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，使你的拳击始终造成全额伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿上 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Mnestia's Raiment</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每次出拳都会招来神圣惩戒，效果随你的幸运值提升。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>制作祭坛。用无限之魂献祭一块骨块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 第一重负担只阻挡武器和工具。你的拳头从未被它覆盖。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "0C9D3679760D48F9"
			min_width: 350
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>正确地捶打东西。捶打得很到位的那种。></grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0D807C21019439CC"
