			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>Annointed Handward</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73B4B9E39A9A5152"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>地面重击靴子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>大幅提升了跳跃高度，楼梯和墙壁不再成为障碍。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>撞击地面会基于你的</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>护甲韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>造成范围伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>如果任何东西被卷入其中，你的坠落伤害将被取消，并且会进入一个 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2秒的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>冷却时间。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 着陆时若附近没有物体，你将受到双倍坠落伤害。请小心瞄准。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>用南瓜靴制作祭坛，始于一个净化之心。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "52F9F43E737A777F"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>落在人身上。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5B8B8A7E77AFA806"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:hallowed_steps"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>神圣的脚步</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0C9D3679760D48F9"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>远程的答案</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全绘制的箭矢无视重力，并能穿透路径上的所有敌人。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你最近完全绘制好的箭会持续伤害附近的敌人，伤害取决于你的</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>当前生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>千德卷轴</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>后，其攻击加成也适用于你的投射物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在桦树苗上举行森林仪式，需要十字弓、净化之心、无限之魂和神圣精华。大约需要 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>35分钟</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 投掷物也不受第一重负担的影响。加上召唤物，正义之士有多种战斗方式。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
