			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>救赎的阿尔巴雷斯特</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12A55B549C0DA083"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>在黑暗中移动</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会改变 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Sixth Burden</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，让你无论光照强度如何都能移动，但仅限白天有效。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿上 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Mnestia's Raiment</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，时间就不再重要了，这彻底解决了困扰你的问题。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Albarest of Deliverance</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>搭配使用时，持续的箭矢伤害将转变为持续的治疗效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在祭坛上放置一个自然光环之眼，旁边放一个转换催化剂，需要250,000点光环。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0C34BF60C19E626C"
			min_width: 340
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>修复了黑暗问题。一半的问题。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6BEA7311C29D64FD"
