			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>全知之眼</grad></shadow>"
			x: -0.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["581F2A1C0FD00B9F"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>祝福乘数</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将光明祝福徽章赋予的护甲值和护甲韧性翻倍。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当任何盔甲部件的耐久度降至</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>或更低时，它将得到完全修复并变为</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>不可破坏的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>不可破坏物品现在计入祝福效果，而该效果通常忽略它们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 这样祝福的盔甲一旦脱下就会碎裂。不要随意卸下。重生摇篮可以缓和这一点。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在樱花树苗上举行森林仪式，需要最亮卷轴、附魔金苹果和自然光环护身符。大约70分钟。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
