			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>姆涅斯蒂亚的衣袍</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7327D16EC0A90842"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>共同的痛苦</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在抗性生效前，你受到的任何伤害都会同时作用于你的目标。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将此与大幅降低所受伤害的构筑结合。你几乎不受伤害，而他们承受全额未减免的伤害。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>祭坛上放置牧师头盔、粉碎催化剂、400,000点气场，持续超过两分钟。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0B14F71F5D42F3DA"
			min_width: 340
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>它们能感受到你的感受。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "78B2A822984AAC83"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:broken_mask"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>破碎的荣耀面具</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FACF4DC370F191D"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>自动复活</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 奇物槽位。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>死亡后立即复活，之后进入 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>40秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的冷却时间。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>携带一个 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Ambrosial Arbor</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 可以让你消耗一个来立即重置冷却时间，并且回来时会恢复Arbor的所有效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>穿上 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Mnestia's Raiment</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>后，盔甲脱下时不再破碎，只会失去 Unbreakable 标志。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在远古树苗上举行森林仪式，需要天使之心、嗅探者蛋、无限之灵、神圣精华和两棵仙草之林。大约70分钟。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
