			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>神圣之石</grad></shadow>"
			x: 4.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF3157D4471721F"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>周围的一切都安静了下来</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当你靠近时，思绪本身便停止。心智归于寂静，形态被升华，而你附近的一切几乎都静止不动。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>圣化锭、净化之心和炽天使之心环绕着一枚精致戒指。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 你必须同时佩戴七美德之戒，卫道士才会交出神圣恩典。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "66918E2E73AD841F"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>荒芜之重的镜子。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "61C1D9F98ED77B69"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:exaltation_ring"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>崇高的祝福</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["66918E2E73AD841F"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>万物皆有回报</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在以下所有条件都满足的情况下，击杀一个 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Warden</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你佩戴着七美德之戒。</grad></shadow>"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你正穿戴着「崇高祝福」。</grad></shadow>"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的美德时间至少为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>99.5 百分比</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你已获得全部 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 炽天使之心。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>奖章会漂浮在卫道士死亡的位置，只有你能捡起它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>功能说明</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能记住你受到的最后一次伤害的类型。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>来自该类型的伤害将完全无效化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>受到任何其他类型伤害时，伤害会大幅放大。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次无效化都会剥夺攻击者当前生命值的</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次增幅都会为攻击者恢复其最大生命值中 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>20 个百分点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 神秘卷轴栏位。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 面对单一敌人类型，这能让你不死。面对混合战斗，这却是死亡判决。这种张力就是整个设计的精髓。"
				""
				"[!info] 每个玩家一生只会掉落一次。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "7327D16EC0A90842"
			min_width: 380
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>由一位倒下的母系首领锻造而成。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "44F30F3A721A44BF"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:consecration"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>神圣恩典</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EF3157D4471721F"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>圣餐插槽</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"佩戴七美德戒指会开启一个无人拥有的物品栏。这就是要放进去的东西。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>制作一个</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>天界之心</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放置在自然祭坛上，祭坛下方放置一个 </grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>转化催化剂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，注入约 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,200,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的灵气，耗时约 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>10秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 这比一片新田的灵气还要多。你需要一个完善的自然灵气装置，可能还需要一两个宝藏库，这才能成为现实。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>然后选择一个元素</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在远古树苗上举行森林仪式，需要沉睡圣物、三个相同的</grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>升级球体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和四个</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>无限之魂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 仪式大约需要现实时间2小时20分钟。开始后去做别的事情吧。"
			]
			id: "72680109513597DE"
			min_width: 370
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F5C542 to=#F5C542>120万点灵气。据此建造。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7AAE74F84EFCFE70"
				item: "covenant_of_the_seven:dormant_sacrament"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6>沉睡的圣礼</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72680109513597DE"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>与火焰的誓言</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>森林仪式、沉睡圣礼、三个 </grad><grad from=#8FD6FF to=#4FA8E8 f=0.8>火焰升级球体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和四个无限之魂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你受到的所有非火焰伤害都会转化为火焰伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>然后，当你受到 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>火焰</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>伤害时，该伤害会被抵消并反射回攻击者。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>魔法抗性与伤害反射均随区域内</grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>气场</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的强度而变化。每有</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点气场，反射率提升约</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1%</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 负面气场会将这两个数值都转为惩罚。穿戴此物时请勿站在被耗尽的田地中。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还改变了</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Seventh Virtue</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，使反射的伤害修复世界，而非消耗世界。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
