				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你受到的所有非 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Eldritch</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 伤害都会被转化为 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Eldritch</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>然后，当你受到 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Eldritch</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 伤害时，该伤害会被抵消并反射回攻击者。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>魔法抗性与伤害反射均随区域内</grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>气场</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的强度而变化。每有</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点气场，反射率提升约</grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1%</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 负面气场会将这两个数值都转为惩罚。穿戴此物时请勿站在被耗尽的田地中。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还改变了</grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Seventh Virtue</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，使反射的伤害修复世界，而非消耗世界。</grad></shadow>"
			]
